cradicle (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add wallet COB type for cryptocurrency wallet addresses
  * Add seed command for seeding repositories
  * Add --skip and --limit options to crad ls with SQLite caching
  * Add custom Tor SOCKS port support in radicle-node-wrapped
  * Set selective seeding policy by default
  * Fix radicle-node-wrapped for AppImage compatibility
  * Fix empty passphrase handling for private SSH keys

